Z||000005||grinthock||08-27-2001||06:26 AM||||Hey GT Boy I would love to chat with ya, email me directly, as for olivers WWW, the site isn't working for some reason now!<P>Cookstown auto is located on the 5th side road south of Hwy 89.<P>Take 400 South or North to HWY 89 go WEST, make a left at the first street == coffee shop, they are 2 minutes down the road, the fiero's are located on the north end of the lot (a 15 minute walk)<P><p>[This message has been edited by grinthock (edited 08-27-2001).]||||reg||1
